<title>USA: BRE Properties raises dividend.</title>
<headline>BRE Properties raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BRE Properties Inc said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.345 per share of $1.38 on an annual basis.</p>
<p>This compares with the previous annual dividend of $1.32 per share.</p>
</text>
